<p>This notice explains what personal information {{ site_name }} collects through this website and what we do with it. It was last updated on {{ date }}.</p>
<h2>What we collect</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Messages you send us.</strong> When you use the <a href="{{ links.contact }}">contact form</a>, we receive your name, your email address and your message.</li>
<li><strong>Technical information.</strong> Our web server keeps short-lived logs of requests (such as the address of the page and your IP address) to keep the website secure.</li>
</ul>
<p>This website does not use advertising or tracking cookies.</p>
{%- if analytics %}
<h2>Visitor statistics</h2>
<p>To learn which pages are useful, this website counts visits on its own server. It uses no cookies and no tracking code, and it shares nothing with other companies. It never stores your IP address or the details of your browser. It keeps only totals for each day: how many people read each page, which website or search engine sent them, the language of the page, and whether they used a phone, a tablet or a computer. To count each visitor once a day, it uses a code that changes every day and cannot be traced back to you. Searches on this website are counted too, except anything that looks like an email address, a phone number or another long number. Visits are not counted when your browser asks websites not to track you (Global Privacy Control or Do Not Track). The totals are kept for 25 months at most.</p>
{%- endif %}
<h2>How we use it</h2>
<p>We use your message and details only to answer you. We do not sell them or share them with anyone else, unless the law requires us to.</p>
<h2>How long we keep it</h2>
<p>We keep messages for as long as we need them to answer you, and server logs for a short time only.</p>
<h2>Your rights</h2>
<p>You can ask to see, correct or delete the personal information we hold about you. <a href="{{ links.contact }}">Contact us</a> to do so.</p>
